      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swanzey%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town hosts an outdoor amphitheater called the Potash Bowl where residents restage Thompson's melodrama each summer.",
